{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1401394-the-book-of-wonders-wanted-\u2014-solar-charms","id":1401394,"title":"The Book of Wonders Wanted \u2014 Solar Charms","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2020-07-06T14:59:17-07:00","id":1401394,"title":"The Book of Wonders Wanted \u2014 Solar Charms","content":"Just wanted to let everybody know that the first book of my collection of Charms, <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/319627/The-Book-of-Wonders-Wanted--Solars\" target=\"_blank\"><i>The Book of Wonders Wanted,</i></a> is on sale on the Vault with over 30 pages of Solar Charms! Hopefully this will just be the first of several, so if you liked my bestiaries, this is your opportunity.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> &quot;The world will never starve for want of wonders, but only for want of wonder.&quot; This is a collection of brand-new Solar Charms from the author of <i>The Thousand Sanctioned Beasts.</i> Have you ever wanted your Solar to start a farm? Probably not! But with the Charms in this book, it might start to look appealing! I've put together a set of new powers that focuses on helping your character stand out among the rest.<br /> Use this book if you've ever wanted to start a small business, enact the glorious people's revolution, smash a boulder with a finger, demand to see the manager, fall in love, write a novel, give good advice, give bad advice, give hilarious advice, practice austerities, find people who share your hobbies, get really hammered, fish Kejak straight out of Heaven, or abruptly leave the building.<br /> <b>The Book of Wonders Wanted \u2014 if you wonder what wonder you wanted, we want you to wonder what might be in here.</b><br /> <br /> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":5}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T18:09:27-07:00","id":1401816,"title":"","content":"Definitely very interested, but I bit hesitant since you are asking in the price range of 200-300 page fan written supplements, and three times the price of the closest equivalent official supplement of similar length.<br /> <br /> Is there anything more you can tell us to help me justify the expense to myself?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T20:53:58-07:00","id":1401843,"title":"","content":"The layout is really <i>very </i>nice. I'm so pleased with it.<br /> <br /> As far as price goes, I charge what I think my time is worth and I'm pretty heavily-armored against criticism on that front (which I get a fair amount of). My basic take is that the 200-300 page supplements you're referencing, and <i>most RPG products period, </i>are critically undervaluing themselves, and that's why nobody in RPGs can make any money.<br /> <br /> My bestiaries are either $10 or $12, and overall I think people find them to be worth it because I manage to sell a fair amount still (look forward to Sidereals in the near future!).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-08T21:09:10-07:00","id":1401845,"title":"","content":"You could buy a bunch of McDonald's hamburgers for the price of one really good steak, but a bunch of hamburgers will never be a steak, is the best way I could put it. Rand does good work.<br /> <br /> Also, directly comparing it to the 'closest official supplement' might be a little misleading. The Miracles book was a charm overflow/Kickstarter backer request book, after all; a lot of the charms in it are actually kind of naff because someone demanded their honestly rather out-there idea be a Solar charm. I haven't picked up this book just yet but judging by the existing compilations I expect there to be more usable text.<br /> <br /> Also Rand does put have his stuff go on sale when Drivethru holds them, so, hey. You can be patient if you must.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2334-aliasi","name":"Aliasi","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2334_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"197"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-15T14:50:10-07:00","id":1402986,"title":"","content":"Although not that patient, since Christmas in July just started and the book is now 25% off.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-17T03:00:54-07:00","id":1403200,"title":"","content":"Do you have a Subscribe Star or Patreon account, Rand Brittain?<br /> <br /> Would would entice you to make a 2.5 Edition of this book?<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/4428-daredevil","name":"Daredevil","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar4428_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"404"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-18T06:28:55-07:00","id":1403378,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Daredevil</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1401394-the-book-of-wonders-wanted-\u2014-solar-charms?p=1403200#post1403200\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Do you have a Subscribe Star or Patreon account, Rand Brittain?<br /> <br /> Would would entice you to make a 2.5 Edition of this book?</div> </div> </div> </div>Five hundred dollars.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/215-rand-brittain","name":"Rand Brittain","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar215_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"181"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-21T08:07:59-07:00","id":1403816,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>glamourweaver</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1401394-the-book-of-wonders-wanted-\u2014-solar-charms?p=1401816#post1401816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Definitely very interested, but I bit hesitant since you are asking in the price range of 200-300 page fan written supplements, and three times the price of the closest equivalent official supplement of similar length.<br /> <br /> Is there anything more you can tell us to help me justify the expense to myself?</div> </div> </div> </div>I grabbed it with the Christmas in July sale and I must say I'm extremely impressed. There's a lot of fun charm space it addresses, and a number of them add ways to Interact with other subsystems in fun ways as well as addressing a bunch of fun tropes.<br /> <br /> A particularly noteworthy one, in my opinion, being Everything-Giving Physician's Bounty. Let's you use treatment as a minor/major intimacy. Does the &quot;we don't care who they were before, they've done nothing but good for our little community&quot; trope super well.<br /> <br /> <br /> Minor detail for OP, though. All the page numbers are wrong in the index. (Above charm says its on page 18, the page and pdf both say its 20.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><div align=\"center\"><b><i>Exalted Behind a Screen of Jade, Savant of the Immaculate Texts, No Moon Scholar</i>, Good Sitting Dog, Best Lurking Cat with Bones, Pioneer Pooch, Corsair, <i>Director, Keeper of the Karstein Manor</i>, Scion with Shield of Knowledge, Erymanthian Boar,<i> Seeking Awakened, Cloaked Changeling, Family Head, Kindred, Agent, Poltergeist</i>, Disciple of the Antler Crown, Wraith, Conspiracy Theorist, <i>First Time Traveler</i></b></div>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/882-samuraimujuru","name":"SamuraiMujuru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar882_3.jpg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1129"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2020-07-22T11:28:35-07:00","id":1404054,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>SamuraiMujuru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/1401394-the-book-of-wonders-wanted-\u2014-solar-charms?p=1403816#post1403816\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Minor detail for OP, though. All the page numbers are wrong in the index. (Above charm says its on page 18, the page and pdf both say its 20.)</div> </div> </div> </div>I knew inDesign's auto-indexing feature was too good to be true.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://rpg.drivethrustuff.com/product/134196/Chuubos-Marvelous-WishGranting-Engine\" target=\"_blank\">Chuubo's Marvelous Wish-Granting Engine RPG</a> \u2014 <a href=\"http://www.patreon.com/JennaMoran\" target=\"_blank\">Jenna Moran's Patreon</a> \u2014 <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/user?u=451515\" target=\"_blank\">Robert Vance's Patreon</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user"